<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0628_T29R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Lake of Rage is DEADASS a crater\nfrom GYARADOS wildin’ out.\rRain filled it up, and BOOM, a lake.\rThat’s the story from my grandpa’s\ngreat-great-grandpa. He was there.\rYou used to catch lively MAGIKARP\nthere, but now...\rSomethin’ ain’t right.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0628_T29R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Lake of Rage ain’t been right\nsince them men in black showed up.\rSunglasses at night. Who DOES that?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0628_T29R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Lake of Rage back to normal! The\nMAGIKARP came back!\rI might still see the WORLD’S BIGGEST\nMAGIKARP. My life dream. It’s a small\fdream.\rYou got a Rod? Help a old man out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0628_T29R0201_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ah, you got a MAGIKARP!\nLet’s see how big that baby is.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0628_T29R0201_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 52, 0, 0}.{STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0} INCHES!\nA MAGIKARP of {STRVAR_1 52, 0, 0}.{STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0} inches!\rSHEESH! This one is CRAZY! I’m cryin’!\nI tip my hat! My whole hat!\rTake this to remember it!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0628_T29R0201_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The record is what matters.\nThat’s just a bonus!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0628_T29R0201_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 52, 0, 0}.{STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0} inches!\rThat’s wonderful!\n...Or not.\fI seen a bigger one. In my dreams.\fBut still.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0628_T29R0201_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This MAGIKARP is {STRVAR_1 52, 0, 0}.{STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0} inches.\rBut I already seen a MAGIKARP that\nwas {STRVAR_1 52, 2, 0}.{STRVAR_1 50, 3, 0} inches.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0628_T29R0201_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WHAT? That ain’t a MAGIKARP!\nI’m old, not BLIND!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0628_T29R0201_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Your Bag too full!\nNothin’ gon’ fit...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0628_T29R0201_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh... So you ain’t got a big one?\fMaybe next time. Maybe never.\fI’m old, I can wait.</language>
	</row>
</body>
